the relationships between emotional distress and QoL. Satisfaction with information about disease determined emotional  
distress in another study. Social support, general health perceptions, global meaning or spirituality were found to     
improve QoL in four other reports. CONCLUSION Literature about the relationships between psychosocial factors and QoL is
