│ measures.ResultsApproximately a third of the sample reported high levels of general psychopathology, burnout and     │
│ posttraumatic symptoms. Burnout was associated with less job satisfaction, longer time in service, less recovery     │
│ time between incidents, and more frequent exposure to incidents. Burnout and GHQ–28 caseness were more likely in     │
