relationship between resilience, purpose in life, and habituation to pain and determine whether psychosocial 
interventions that target resilience and purpose in life improve habituation and reduce vulnerability to chronic pain. 
PERSPECTIVE This article showed that resilience and a sense of purpose in life were both related to the ability to 
